	quest.35E14024C1CAA863.quest_desc: ["Accessories are items that can give certain stat boosts, including defense, damage, and special abilities (such as limited flight) or double jump."]
	quest.35E14024C1CAA863.quest_subtitle: "They can be found in various places or crafted, up to you to get all of them."
